.Re
.Rs
.%A S. Josefsson
.%A I. Liusvaara
.%T Edwards-Curve Digital Signature Algorithm (EdDSA)
.%R RFC 8032
.%D January 2017
.Re
.Sh SECURITY CONSIDERATIONS
A PIN given to
.Fn nqp11login
is passed to the module as it is; the caller wipes its copy.
The module is code loaded into the process: load only one that is
trusted, by its full path.
